  ✕ `Channel<int>` has no zero value
   ╭─[test.lis:3:11]
 2 │ fn test() {
 3 │   let c = zero<Channel<int>>()
   ·           ──────────┬─────────
   ·                     ╰── `Channel<int>` does not satisfy `Zeroable`
